<title>UK: KfW unit prices 200 million stg December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit prices 200 million stg December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager BZW, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    30.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.937   PAY DATE  S-07.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.362    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2003 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
